    "When you say \"total production hours used must not exceed 15,000 hours\" per quarter, does this 15,000-hour limit apply to the sum of hours across all three products combined in that quarter, or is it a separate 15,000-hour limit for each product individually?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the scope of the 15,000-hour limit (aggregate vs. per-product)."
